{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">熱播劇集《死有對証》番外篇，一連三集的《強迫症的一天》小劇場隆重推出第2彈！今集強迫症女法醫程芷昕（陳曉華飾）勇闖「毒舌上司」林琛（韋家雄飾）的辦公室，二人再次擦出充滿喜感的火花。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"108b7b79-38c2-45b2-b43f-6236ce690048.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026zf0fZP4Xui1789121266.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"108b7b79-38c2-45b2-b43f-6236ce690048.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">程芷昕一踏入上司的辦公室，強迫症便瞬間發作，對眼前的混亂看不過眼，她忍不住動手將原本混亂的桌面整理得整整齊齊，散落的文件全被排得井然有序。她連林琛喝水用的茶杯都不放過，堅持杯柄必須精準對齊時鐘方向。當她正專注將杯柄調向「三點鐘方向」時，林琛突然從口袋掏出一個實體時鐘，親自示範什麼才是真正的「三點鐘」，逼使她連忙將杯柄修正到位。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9402881a-da42-413f-a0fc-e87809dd3e19.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026HFn3p83eo01789121266.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9402881a-da42-413f-a0fc-e87809dd3e19.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">眼見下屬為了一個茶杯柄糾纏不休，毒舌上司林琛瞬間失去耐性，火力全開開火痛罵：「你有病就去睇醫生啦！玩個耳仔玩咁耐！」面對上司的無情嘲諷，程芷昕竟然毫不退縮，更霸氣回頭奪走林琛手中的茶杯，大叫一聲：「攞過嚟呀！」兩人隨即上演一場激烈的「茶杯拉鋸戰」，你推我拉、誰都不肯妥協。此情此景連林琛都忍不住失笑調侃：「睇嚟個杯真係幾好玩喎！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1eb2d1a8-8c83-4448-81f3-18fe95b6f829.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026bDRhyxmgb31789121266.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1eb2d1a8-8c83-4448-81f3-18fe95b6f829.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">短片最後，程芷昕趁其不備，直接搶走杯子並奪門而出，留下林琛一人在辦公桌前無奈回味一句：「仲有一滴。」兩人互動場面既逗趣又充滿喜感，為緊張的正劇劇情增添了不少歡樂氣氛！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-13T14:19:08.892288+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":505,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}